{
  "title": "Oven-Roasted Syrian Fermented Lentils Casserole",
  "description": "A hearty, anti-inflammatory casserole of fermented lentils with aromatic spices, finished in a bain-marie for silky texture.",
  "cuisine": "Syrian",
