      "amount": "2 tbsp",
      "notes": "for garnish"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "In a large skillet, heat olive oil over medium heat and sauté onion until translucent.",
    "Add garlic and cook until fragrant.",
    "Stir in diced tomatoes, cumin, nutmeg, thyme, salt, and pepper, and simmer for 5 minutes.",
    "Combine cooked lentils with the tomato mixture and transfer to a baking dish.",
    "Place the dish into a larger pan and pour water up to half the height of the casserole for bain-marie.",
    "Cover tightly with foil and bake for 30 minutes.",
    "Remove the foil, stir, and continue baking for another 10 minutes until bubbling and lightly browned.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley before serving."
